- Ouais.

01:28:37.604 --> 01:28:39.516
Ouais ouais ouais.

01:28:45.278 --> 01:28:47.395
Hé, Ratso!

01:28:47.489 --> 01:28:51.403
Whoopee-tee-yi-yo, mon garçon! Whoo-hah!

01:29:20.021 --> 01:29:21.853
Eh bien, ça arrive.

01:29:23.650 --> 01:29:27.064
